"""v4.2: four ready-made characters, so the players have someone to be.

Fifth edition, first level, built by the standard rules from the System Reference Document 5.1, which its owner
released under CC BY 4.0. The sheet carries the credit line that license asks for, word for word, and calls itself
"5E compatible", which is the wording the same document allows.

Every number on a card is worked out by the page from the character's scores, armor and training, so a card cannot
disagree with itself. The test checks each one against a table worked out by hand.

There are no ready-made characters for the other rules button: the publisher of that game lists character-building
apps as outside its third-party license."""
import sys; sys.path.insert(0, __file__.rsplit('/', 1)[0])
